sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as Researcher
    participant CLI as emede --share
    participant S as tiny_http server
    participant R as Registry file
    participant P as Phone browser

    U->>CLI: emede --share notes.md
    activate CLI
    CLI->>R: read active_shares.json
    alt server already running
        R-->>CLI: port 7777, auth key
        CLI->>S: register note hash
    else no server
        CLI->>S: bind 0.0.0.0:7777
        activate S
        CLI->>R: write instance + key
    end
    Note over CLI,S: hash is stable across restarts
    loop every request
        P->>S: GET /n/3fa9c?key=...
        S->>S: inline images as data URIs
        S-->>P: self-contained HTML
    end
    U->>CLI: Ctrl+C
    CLI->>R: remove instance
    deactivate S
    deactivate CLI
